  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA value remains network-concentrated:</strong> the top chains continue to capture the majority of distributed issuance and often set near-term market direction. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/10/21/solana-s-alpenglow-its-biggest-network-overhaul-since-2020-goes-live-wednesday\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Solana\u2019s Alpenglow, its biggest network overhaul since 2020, goes live Wednesday</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Institutional expansion is likely staged:</strong> large-scale adoption typically lands on proven networks first, then broadens as compliance, interoperability, and liquidity deepen. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-10-20-moonpay-upbit-dunamu-421476\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MoonPay, Upbit parent Dunamu explore collaboration on stablecoin payments, GIWA expansion</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Custody and issuance integrations are moving rankings first:</strong> Chains that win custody and issuance integrations usually pull distributed value share before the broader RWA market total catches up. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQSk5INEpLWm1MQUpVWDlOUkhLYVU0Yy14bjByMENHY2Z5MVpUUUsyOXRhSmhWVnZIbk5BMUxTYV9wMDZyQ2Nqd0NWT09Ua2UwOGJTNU1vekdyRHdkZXBpcTRVMkJZc0g0Si1BdXo1Rm1kQnhqbzZuUzJpbnRCN1VCa1Y4WVZIc2F4UDlab2N0Z1pfUjRpQ3RjeA?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AnchorWatch Trust Company launches bitcoin custody service with up to $370 million in insurance per client</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
